<title>USA: CCC seeks up to 16,910 T HRW wheat for Mozambique.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks up to 16,910 T HRW wheat for Mozambique.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it was tendering on November 20 for up to 16,910 tonnes of U.S. number two hard red winter wheat for export to Mozambique.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for December 5-31.</p>
<p>--Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
